## AI bug identified and fixed
. I encountered an error occurred because the variable/element was being even before it was grabbed from the DOM causes code to crash. Another error occurred as eventlistener was being added to the element even before it was generated. I fixed both the buys by identifying the snipped of code causing the issue and calling the functions at the correct places.

